[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（２８３プロダクションに入社して数か月……\r\nいよいよ俺が、アイドルをプロデュースする時が来た）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ずっと憧れていた仕事をようやく任されたんだ、\r\nこれから精一杯頑張るぞ！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはようございます！\r\nって、天井社長……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "おはよう、お前を待っていたぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1902001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この２８３プロダクションを束ねる\r\n天井社長……あいかわらずダンディな雰囲気だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "お前には今日から、アイドルを\r\nプロデュースしてもらうと伝えていたが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1902001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "素晴らしい結果を期待させてもらう\r\n私は甘くないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1902001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "は、はい！　よろしくお願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "よろしい。では、仕事の説明ははづきに任せて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1902001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？　はづきさんはどこにも……あっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そ、ソファの裏で誰かが倒れてる！？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "……ふわぁ～？\r\nなんですか～急に大きな声出して～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "は、はづき……なぜ床で寝ているんだ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1902001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "すみません、ソファへ着く前に\r\n眠気に負けてしまいまして～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010060,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "せっかくまじめな雰囲気を出したというのに……",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1902001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010070,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……ともかく！\r\n彼に仕事の説明をしてくれ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1902001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい、もちろんです\r\nプロデューサーさん、どうぞ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\n……あいかわらず、わかりやすくまとまってますね、資料",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（はづきさん、こういうところは頼れるんだよな……）",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nそれじゃあ、さっそくお仕事の説明に入りますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "まず、今回のプロデュースの目標についてですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ワンダーアイドルノヴァ・グランプリ……\r\n通称『W.I.N.G.』への出場を目指してください",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』……ですか",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい\r\n新人アイドルの祭典とも言われる、すごいライブなんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010080,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "祭典と言われるだけあって、この『W.I.N.G.』は\r\n出場資格を手に入れるまでが厳しいんです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010090,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "エントリーしたアイドルは開催前まで、\r\n全４回のシーズンごとに審査を受けます",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010100,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "その時、一定のランクに達していないと、\r\n出場資格を失ってしまうんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010110,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ですので、精一杯頑張っていきましょ～！\r\n私もたくさんサポートさせていただきますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010080,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……少しアドバイスをしておくが、\r\nお前は、２８３プロダクションのプロデューサーだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1902001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010090,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "担当アイドルと他のアイドルたちを\r\n交流させることも重要になってくる",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1902001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010100,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "互いに影響しあうことで目指せる高みもあるだろう",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1902001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010110,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "まあ、まずは思うようにやってみるといい\r\n結果がついてくるかは、お前とアイドルの頑張り次第だ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1902001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010120,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "では、そろそろお仕事に移ってもらいましょうか\r\n今回プロデュースするアイドルは──",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010220,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "オーディションで選んでください～\r\nこちらは、オーディションを受ける子たちの資料になります",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1901001010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……わかりました\r\nじゃあ、行ってきますね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgEffect": "mask",
    "bg": "00014",
    "bgm": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010010,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "015",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大崎甜花さん、ですね\r\n今日はよろしくお願いします",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010020,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ひゃっ！\r\n……は、はい……よろしくお願いします……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えーと……ごめんね\r\n驚かせちゃったかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "い、いえ……\r\nあの……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花……あんまり、他の人と話さないから……\r\nちょっと、びっくりしちゃっただけ……です……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなんだ。でもオーディションだからって\r\nあんまり緊張せずに、楽しく話してもらえばいいからね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "楽しく話す……\r\nえ、えっと……頑張ります……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで、大崎さんはどうしてアイドルになろうと\r\n思ったのかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "えっと……甜花はアイドルって……\r\nよくわかんないけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なーちゃんが、一緒にアイドルになろうって……\r\n言ってくれたから……です……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なーちゃん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ、えっと……なーちゃんは……甜花の妹で……\r\n甘奈ちゃん、だから……なーちゃんって、呼んでる……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（妹……書類に双子の妹がいると書いてあったな\r\nあの子のことか）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなんだ。妹さんの言葉でアイドルになろうって\r\n思えるぐらい、妹さんのことが好きなんだね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "はい……なーちゃんは……いつも優しくて、元気で……\r\n甜花、大好き……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いい子なんだね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\n甜花、アイドルなんて……できるのかなって、思うけど……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でもなーちゃん、あんなふうに、言ってくれたから……\r\nなーちゃんのためにも、頑張ろうって……思います……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（妹さんのことを話すときの笑顔……\r\nこの笑顔を見てるとこっちまで楽しくなってくるな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（周りから魅力を引き出してあげれば\r\nすごいアイドルになるのかもしれない！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、君は合格だ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "え……本当……？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花が……アイドル……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、俺が君のプロデューサーだ\r\nよろしく、甜花さん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010140,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "は、はい……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花……頑張りましゅ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ、頑張ります……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500101/1015001010160"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]